{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33777","headline":"追和虎丘寺清远道士诗 · 皮日休","name":"追和虎丘寺清远道士诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成道自衰周，避世穷炎汉。\n荆杞虽云梗，烟霞尚容窜。\n兹岑信灵异，吾怀惬流玩。\n石涩古铁鉎，岚重轻埃漫。\n松膏腻幽径，苹沫着孤岸。\n诸萝幄幕暗，衆鸟陶匏乱。\n岩罅地中心，海光天一半。\n玄猨行列归，白云次第散。\n蟾蜍生夕景，沆瀣余清旦。\n风日采幽什，墨客学灵翰。\n嗟予慕斯文，一咏复三叹。\n显晦虽不同，兹吟粗堪赞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}